# Audit evidence is regenerated by re-running the scripts, so the bulky
# artefacts stay out of the repository. Reports, scripts and the inventory are
# tracked; screenshots, produced media and captured CSVs are not. Findings
# cite these paths, so re-run the area's script to reproduce one.
out/
out-*/
*.png
*.mp4
*.m4a
*.webm
*.mkv
*.csv
*.part
logs.json
